格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Web 番茄钟插件：可配置专注与休息时长，提供侧栏入口和可拖动浮动面板","id":"gh:1333515140","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-pomodoro","slug":"causebefore/dsh-pomodoro","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","javascript","pomodoro","pomodoro-timer","productivity"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Web 番茄钟插件：可配置专注与休息时长，提供侧栏入口和可拖动浮动面板"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"🍅 dsh-pomodoro"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A Pomodoro plugin that adds focus and break cycles to the DeepSeek Harness Web UI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English ·\n简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Interface Preview ·\nHighlights ·\nQuick Start ·\nUsage ·\nSettings and Notifications ·\nTroubleshooting"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Compatibility:** DeepSeek Harness is evolving quickly, so this plugin tracks rc releases only: d"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"evelopment and verification target rc baselines, with no commitment to intermediate prereleases such"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" as alpha. The DSH version each release targets is noted in its Releases notes; after upgrading DSH,"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" confirm compatibility against the release notes."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Interface Preview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Supports light and dark themes, a compact mini mode, and configuration through DSH plugin settings."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Light theme\nDark theme"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Mini mode"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Settings"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Settings in the dark theme"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Native DSH integration:** Open Pomodoro from the sidebar and manage its options from the DSH plu"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"gin settings page.\n- **Complete timer controls:** Start, pause, reset, or skip a phase, with a circu"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"lar progress indicator, phase status, and completed-focus count.\n- **Cross-session recovery:** Reloa"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ding DSH—or reopening it after closing a tab or restarting the browser—resumes from the original dea"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"dline. If the active phase expired while DSH was closed, it is settled once.\n- **Low-distraction min"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"i mode:** Collapse the panel to the phase, countdown, and primary control while retaining drag, expa"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"nd, and close actions.\n- **Configurable cycles:** Set focus and break durations independently, and c"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"hoose whether breaks or the next focus session start automatically.\n- **Completion feedback:** Alway"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"s receive an in-app DSH reminder when a phase ends, with optional sound and background system notifi"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"cations.\n- **DSH language support:** Follows the DSH global locale for Chinese and English. Switchin"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"g languages updates the mounted plugin UI without resetting the timer or unsaved settings draft.\n- *"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"*Interface-aware:** Adapts to DSH light and dark themes, keyboard operation, and the reduced-motion "},{"id":"p14s13","text":"aware:** Adapts to DSH light and dark themes, keyboard operation, and the reduced-motion preference."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Component | Requirement |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness | Verified versions are listed in each plugin release note |\n| Node.js | `^22.19."},{"id":"p17s2","text":"0` or `>=24.0.0` |\n| DSH profile | `web`; headless profiles do not provide the UI |\n| pnpm | Availab"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"le from the command line |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Install the plugin into the `web` profile:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Then start or restart DSH Web:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The plugin is loaded when the 🍅 button appears at the bottom of the sidebar."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Install from the DSH UI"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Prefer staying in the Web UI? Two community companions can install this plugin for you:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **dsh-market** — install it once with `dsh plugin --profile web add dshmarket` and restart `dsh we"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"b`, then open **Settings → Plugin Market**, search for `dsh-pomodoro`, and install it with one click"},{"id":"p26s3","text":". The plugin goes live after a page refresh.\n- **dsh-find-plugin** — install it once with `dsh plugi"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"n --profile web add dsh-find-plugin` and restart `dsh web`, then just tell the agent: \"install the d"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"sh-pomodoro plugin for DSH\". It finds the plugin and runs the install for you; refresh the browser w"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"in for DSH\". It finds the plugin and runs the install for you; refresh the browser when it finishes."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Click the sidebar 🍅 button to open or close the panel. Drag the title bar to reposition it. Use **Mi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ni** in the title bar to hide secondary information, and **Expand** to restore the full panel."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Control | Behavior |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Start / Pause | Start or pause the current phase |\n| Reset | Restore the current phase to its full"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" duration and pause it |\n| Skip | Move to the next phase and keep it paused |\n| Mini / Expand | Swit"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ch between the low-obstruction layout and full controls |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Settings and Notifications"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"On newer DSH hosts, open **Plugins → dsh-pomodoro** from the sidebar and expand **Pomodoro**. On old"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"er hosts, use **Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration → Pomodoro**. Both provide the same six se"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"s, use **Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration → Pomodoro**. Both provide the same six settings:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Setting | Default | Behavior |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Focus duration | 25 minutes | Full duration of eac"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"h focus phase; accepts an integer from 1 to 240 minutes |\n| Break duration | 5 minutes | Full durati"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"on of each break phase; accepts an integer from 1 to 240 minutes |\n| Start breaks automatically | On"},{"id":"p33s4","text":" | Start the break when a focus phase ends naturally |\n| Start the next focus session automatically "},{"id":"p33s5","text":"| Off | Start the next focus session when a break ends naturally |\n| Play a sound when a phase ends "},{"id":"p33s6","text":"| Off | Play the completion sound three times; a preview is available |\n| Send system notifications "},{"id":"p33s7","text":"in the background | Off | Send a browser notification while the DSH page is in the background |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"If the current phase has not started, a new duration takes effect immediately. Once timing has start"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ed, the new duration applies from the next phase."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"On newer DSH hosts that persist remote settings, authenticated remote browsers can also save and cle"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ar them. On initial page load, Pomodoro waits for the host settings before starting a timer or settl"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ing a phase that expired while the page was closed, avoiding default durations or automatic-start op"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"tions. Older hosts without remote settings continue to use the defaults."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Migrating older settings"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"On hosts with the newer settings system, the plugin automatically reads the `dsh-pomodoro` section o"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"f `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml`, falling back to `settings.yaml.imported` when the original is absent. I"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"t imports only the six valid fields listed above and only fills fields that are not explicitly confi"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"gured in the newer configuration. The original file is preserved; invalid fields are skipped with a "},{"id":"p37s5","text":"diagnostic in the host log."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The host saves the imported values and an internal completion marker in one write. **Clear custom se"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ttings** restores inherited values without importing old values again after a restart. If reading or"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" writing fails, existing configuration is preserved. Fix the old file format or permissions and rest"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"art to retry, or configure the plugin from its detail page."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
